==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Houndoom|59}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Undaunted|Houndoom|5}} from the {{TCG|Undaunted}} expansion.
*'''Diving Swipe''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Honchkrow|73}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

